      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "実はあの廃屋の所有者は私なのだ。\n猛獣たちも私が飼っていたんだが\nある日、檻の鍵をかけ忘れてね……\nお陰で邪魔者はいなくなった。礼をいうぞ！",
        "official_en": "Actually, I'm the owner of that abandoned house.\nI used to keep beasts, but one day I forgot to lock\nthe cage and, well, here we are. But they're gone\nnow, thanks to you!",
